Required fields missing from two structs the lens writes empty: one
diagnostic for each struct, since each fix is written in its own body.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
	audit: {
		by: string
		at: string
	}
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		id: v0_0.id
		meta: {}
		audit: {}
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
	audit: {
		by: string
		at: string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0346]: ForwardLens produces nothing for meta.owner and meta.team, which v1.0 requires
  --> history/1.0.thema:17:3
   |
17 |         meta: {}
   |         ^^^^
   |
   = help: add owner: <mapping>, team: <mapping> to v1_0.meta

error[E0346]: ForwardLens produces nothing for audit.by and audit.at, which v1.0 requires
  --> history/1.0.thema:18:3
   |
18 |         audit: {}
   |         ^^^^^
   |
   = help: add by: <mapping>, at: <mapping> to v1_0.audit
